flowchart TB
  A["Lead dispatches scoped work, then stops"] --> B["Owner returns candidate and evidence"]
  B --> C["Required reviewer returns verdict and findings"]
  C --> D{"Lead routes result"}
  D -->|PASS| E["Next authorized step or finish"]
  D -->|BLOCKED| F["Wait for named condition, then resume"]
  D -->|FAIL| G{"Failed repair rounds?"}
  G -->|0 or 1| H["Targeted repair, then affected verification"]
  G -->|2 or more| I["Report evidence and next decision"]
  I --> J["Different approach within scope and budget"]
  I --> K["Same approach requires user steering"]
